    publication of derivative works of this document for use as a technical
    specification is expressly prohibited.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">The notice is:</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">"Copyright © [$date-of-document] Eclipse Foundation. This software
    or document includes material copied from or derived from [title and URI
    of the Eclipse Foundation specification document]."</fo:block>
                        <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-size="9pt"
                                  line-height="11pt"
                                  space-before="6pt">Disclaimers</fo:block>
                        <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                  space-before.maximum="5pt">THIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED "AS IS," AND THE COPYRIGHT HOLDERS AND
